cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use agent-eval-harness in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "agent-eval-harness: reproducible cross-model regression testing for coding models and agents"
abstract: >-
  A harness that runs the same coding tasks across models and agent CLIs, grades every attempt
  against withheld tests in an isolated subprocess, keeps per-attempt evidence, and reports
  unbiased pass@k over repeated attempts so that model and version regressions can be measured.
type: software
authors:
